  m_Text: 'DRIVING RANGE

    Squeeze GRIP to pick up the driver

    Swing through
    the ball to drive it

    Flight trail + distance after every shot

    A fresh
    ball appears on the tee

    Trackpad RIGHT: club angle

    Orange buttons:
    CLEAR BALLS / CLUB BACK'
